{"unit_id":"tag:08H3:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为赋环拓扑斯的态射（morphism of ringed topoi）。若 <MATH_0002> 为由 <MATH_0003>-模（modules）组成的严格（strictly）完美复形（perfect complex），则 <MATH_0004> 为由 <MATH_0005>-模（modules）组成的严格（strictly）完美复形（perfect complex）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"morphism of ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯的态射"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"strictly","target_term":"严格"},{"source_term":"perfect complex","target_term":"完美复形"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"strictly","target_term":"严格"},{"source_term":"perfect complex","target_term":"完美复形"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"morphism of ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯的态射","context":"拉回复形的态射"},{"source_term":"strictly","target_term":"严格","context":"输入与输出的完美性限定词"},{"source_term":"perfect complex","target_term":"完美复形","context":"严格限定下拉回保持的对象"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"两端的系数"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08H3:proof","translation":"已在《位点上的模（Modules on Sites）》引理 <REF_0001> 中看到：有限自由（finite free）模（module）的拉回（pullback）是有限自由（finite free）的。函子（functor）<MATH_0001> 是加性（additive）函子（functor），因而保持直和因子（direct summands）。引理得出。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"位点上的模"},{"source_term":"finite free","target_term":"有限自由"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"拉回"},{"source_term":"finite free","target_term":"有限自由"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"additive","target_term":"加性"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"direct summands","target_term":"直和因子"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"位点上的模","context":"引用章节"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"拉回","context":"系数模的拉回"},{"source_term":"finite free","target_term":"有限自由","context":"拉回保持的性质"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"输入系数"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"拉回函子"},{"source_term":"additive","target_term":"加性","context":"函子的加性"},{"source_term":"direct summands","target_term":"直和因子","context":"由加性保持的分裂部分"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08FN:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为赋环位点（ringed site）。设 <MATH_0002> 为 <MATH_0003> 的对象（object）。给定实线（solid）图（diagram），由 <MATH_0004>-模（modules）组成，\n<MATH_0005>，\n其中 <MATH_0006> 是有限自由（finite free）<MATH_0007>-模（module）的直和因子（direct summand），且 <MATH_0008> 满射（surjective），则存在覆盖（covering）<MATH_0009>，使得在每个 <MATH_0010> 上存在虚线箭头（dotted arrow），令图（diagram）交换（commute）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"solid","target_term":"实线"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"finite free","target_term":"有限自由"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"direct summand","target_term":"直和因子"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"dotted arrow","target_term":"虚线箭头"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"commute","target_term":"交换"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点","context":"局部提升的定义环境"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"取局部覆盖的对象"},{"source_term":"solid","target_term":"实线","context":"给定箭头的图示限定词"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图","context":"提升问题的图"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"图中对象的系数"},{"source_term":"direct summand","target_term":"直和因子","context":"源的局部投射性质"},{"source_term":"finite free","target_term":"有限自由","context":"源所在自由模"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"有限自由系数"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"给定箭头的性质"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"局部提升存在的覆盖"},{"source_term":"dotted arrow","target_term":"虚线箭头","context":"要构造的提升"},{"source_term":"commute","target_term":"交换","context":"提升需满足的图相容性"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08FN:proof","translation":"可假设 <MATH_0001>，对某个 <MATH_0002>。此时，找到虚线箭头（dotted arrow）等价（equivalent）于提升（lifting）基（basis）元素（elements）在 <MATH_0003> 中的像（images）。由层（sheaves）的满射（surjective）映射（maps）的刻画，这局部可行（《位点（Sites）》第 <REF_0001> 节）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"dotted arrow","target_term":"虚线箭头"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"lifting","target_term":"提升"},{"source_term":"basis","target_term":"基"},{"source_term":"elements","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"images","target_term":"像"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"位点"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"dotted arrow","target_term":"虚线箭头","context":"局部提升"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价","context":"提升问题的等价描述"},{"source_term":"lifting","target_term":"提升","context":"基元素的局部提升"},{"source_term":"images","target_term":"像","context":"基元素在目标中的像"},{"source_term":"basis","target_term":"基","context":"有限自由模的基"},{"source_term":"elements","target_term":"元素","context":"要提升的基元素"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"层映射的局部刻画"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"层之间的满射"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"系数层"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"位点","context":"引用章节"}],"notes":[]}
